{
 "en": {
  "text": "Every voice tells a story before it says a single word. The pace, the pauses, and the small rise at the end of a question are the details that make speech feel human. This project started with a simple goal: take a short reference recording, and let it read any script, in Hindi or English, without sounding like a machine. It runs entirely on a laptop graphics card with six gigabytes of memory.",
